  },
  "content_case_mfg_leads_pilot": "诚实记录试点调整过程，比吹嘘「全自动」更能赢得内部评审同事信任。建议对外转发时一并说明人工确认路径。",
  "@content_case_mfg_leads_pilot": {
    "description": "content.case.mfg-leads.pilot",
    "x-blockhub-key": "content.case.mfg-leads.pilot"
  },
  "content_case_mfg_leads_story_0": "某 800 人规模精密零部件制造企业，日均新增 CRM 线索约 40 条。销售团队反馈：高价值线索经常在 2–3 小时后才首次联系，竞品已抢先触达。",
  "@content_case_mfg_leads_story_0": {
    "description": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.0",
    "x-blockhub-key": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.0"
  },
  "content_case_mfg_leads_story_1": "**第一次试点**：团队选择「全自动外呼」作为首个场景。上线 4 周后遭遇销售抵制——话术不可控、客户体验差、业绩归属不清。信息部门也提出外呼合规顾虑，试点叫停。",
  "@content_case_mfg_leads_story_1": {
    "description": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.1",
    "x-blockhub-key": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.1"
  },
  "content_case_mfg_leads_story_2": "**方案调整**：改为「智能体草拟话术 + 人工确认后发送」。新线索进入 CRM 后 30 分钟内，智能体根据客户画像生成跟进建议，销售审阅确认后一键发送。",
  "@content_case_mfg_leads_story_2": {
    "description": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.2",
    "x-blockhub-key": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.2"
  },
  "content_case_mfg_leads_story_3": "**验收验证**：使用 200 条脱敏真实线索验证，平均首响 P50 从 3.2 小时降至 28 分钟，一线采纳率 72%。销售主管与信息部门书面确认达标，项目进入商务立项。",
  "@content_case_mfg_leads_story_3": {
    "description": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.3",
    "x-blockhub-key": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.3"
  },
  "content_case_mfg_leads_story_4": "**可转发材料**：案例详情与 [一页纸摘要](/downloads/one-pager-mfg.pdf) 可在 [落地案例](/cases) 下载；同行业客户可参考 [制造行业方案](/industry/mfg) 场景清单。",
  "@content_case_mfg_leads_story_4": {
    "description": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.4",
    "x-blockhub-key": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.4"
  },
  "content_case_mfg_leads_story_5": "**经验总结**：首个场景务必保留 [人工确认路径](/trust/security-faq)；指标需双方书面确认，诚实记录调整过程比强调「全自动」更能通过内部评审。",
  "@content_case_mfg_leads_story_5": {
    "description": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.5",
    "x-blockhub-key": "content.case.mfg-leads.story.5"
  },
  "content_case_mfg_leads_summary": "第一次全自动外呼试点被否 → 改人工确认版 → 平均首响由约 3.2 小时缩短至 28 分钟",
